information about scholarship programs, assists applicants with the application process and organizes events to promote study and research opportunities in Germany. Information and Consultations The DAAD regularly hosts the following to provide insights into scholarship opportunities and application processes: Information Sessions One-on-one Consultations Watch an introductory video on DAAD scholarships for candidates from South Asia © DAAD ASND Study and Research in Germany Germany is renowned for the excellent quality of education it provides. German universities combine research and studies and have been the scene for ground-breaking discoveries. Every year, thousands of international scholars choose to study in Germany and the DAAD offers funding opportunities for the purpose. Click here to see the DAAD scholarships available . Study and Research in South Asia If you wish to study or conduct research in any of the aforementioned South Asian countries, click on the page below to see the DAAD scholarships available – Funding to study and research in India, Bangladesh, Bhutan, Nepal and Sri Lanka (Page coming soon)", "kind": "html", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, minimum-scale=1\">\n    <title>DAAD Scholarships: To and From Germany - DAAD India</title>\n    <link rel=\"pingback\" href=\"https://www.daad.in/xmlrpc.php\">\n    \n\n\n<meta name='robots' content='max-image-preview:large' />\n<style id=\"wp-img-auto-sizes-contain-inline-css\">\nimg:is([sizes=auto i],[sizes^=\"auto,\" i]){contain-intrinsic-size:3000px 1500px}\n/*# sourceURL=wp-img-auto-sizes-contain-inline-css */\n</style>\n<style id=\"classic-theme-styles-inline-css\">\n/*! This file is auto-generated */\n.wp-block-button__link{color:#fff;background-color:#32373c;border-radius:9999px;box-shadow:none;text-decoration: